Package: multiprofile-native
Version: 1.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-flask, python3-pkg-resources
Recommends: chromium | chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable, python3-webview
Maintainer: Multiprofile Native Maintainers <maintainers@localhost>
Description: Native Linux Multiprofile manager
 Clean Linux rewrite of the Multiprofile desktop manager.
 Uses a local Flask API, optional WebView UI, and system Chromium.
 Does not require Wine.
